# Netlify / Cloudflare Pages edge redirects.
#
# Language negotiation at "/" is done by the gate page (src/pages/index.astro),
# NOT here. Netlify serves an existing file in preference to a redirect rule,
# so these two lines only apply if that page is ever missing from the build.
#
# They were briefly forced with `!`, which did make the edge rule fire — and in
# doing so made it impossible for a returning visitor's saved language to be
# read, because the only code that reads it lives on the page the force was
# skipping. Accept-Language is a guess about a browser; `wcc-lang` is a choice
# the reader actually made, and the choice has to win. The gate falls back to
# Accept-Language itself when there is no saved choice, so nothing is lost.
/  /zh  302  Language=zh
/  /en  302

# Legacy Squarespace URLs -> their new homes, so years of existing links,
# bookmarks and search results keep working.
